{"schema":"observatorio-enso/4","publicationId":"20261021T0234Z-17aeb8e1","generatedAt":"2026-10-21T02:34:35+00:00","groups":[{"id":"oficial","label":"Comunicados y avisos oficiales","items":[{"group":"oficial","id":"enfen","institution":"ENFEN","kind":"comunicado","title":"Comunicado oficial N° 18-2026: Alerta de El Niño Costero","text":"El Niño Costero se extendería hasta el otoño de 2027. La Temperatura Superficial del Mar del Pacifico continúa presentando anomalías positivas con tendencia ascendente (Figura 1). Frente a la costa peruana (región Niño 1+2) es más probable que calentamiento del mar (El Niño costero) se mantenga con una magnitud de extraordinaria hasta enero de 2027 (Figura 2), para luego disminuir a fuerte hasta inicios del otoño de 2027.","date":"2026-10-16","next":"2026-10-30","url":"https://www.dhn.mil.pe/Archivos/oceanografia/enfen/comunicado-oficial/18-2026.pdf","stale":false,"newerListed":null,"channel":"mirror","level":"alert"},{"group":"oficial","id":"noaa","institution":"NOAA / CPC","kind":"discusión diagnóstica","title":"ENSO Diagnostic Discussion: Advertencia de El Niño","text":"El Niño continues to strengthen, with a strong-to-very strong El Niño likely through January-March 2027 (remaining greater than an 83% chance). El Niño strengthened further last month, with sea surface temperature anomalies exceeding +4.0°C in portions of the eastern equatorial Pacific","date":"2026-10-08","next":"2026-11-12","url":"https://www.cpc.ncep.noaa.gov/products/analysis_monitoring/enso_advisory/ensodisc.shtml","stale":false,"channel":"direct","level":"alert"}]},{"id":"indices","label":"Índices oficiales","items":[{"group":"indices","id":"icen","institution":"ENFEN / IGP","kind":"mensual","title":"ICEN oficial","value":3.98,"units":"degC","period":"2026-08","periodKind":"month","date":"2026-08-31","change":0.6,"category":"Cálida extraordinaria","tone":"warm","url":"https://siofen.imarpe.gob.pe/nivel2/indice-costero-el-nino-icen","channel":"direct","stale